ど……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/M22qLVdBMJmg5tCEFDhw9Pi7jxbrO2FV.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Battle_In_2","category":"battle","text":"我已经看到胜利的剧本啦！","text_original":"勝利へのシナリオが見えた！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/mSTH7ppA6UVXeSFJuk58iVtzPPvUeowG.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Battle_Recovery_1","category":"battle","text":"要随时关注体力槽哦！","text_original":"体力ゲージはいつも、注意深く確認しておかなきゃね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/nxkhna1zw3Lz9ivCkAr98gueEqqbHN21.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Battle_Retire","category":"battle","text":"要是，提前看了攻略就好了……","text_original":"攻略本……読んでおけばよかった……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/oHZWLbiPk6jy3iqHwHSH7L828MIfM4wG.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Battle_Shout_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"えぃー！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/AmS6OnJxiZV1pViNNdlMYeSgQ7dZ8SCx.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Battle_Shout_2","category":"battle","text":"看招！","text_original":"喰らえ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/FzNMn4u9ukUVSDu4rC3cm0CRprSO754X.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Battle_Shout_3","category":"battle","text":"瞄准啦！","text_original":"行くよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/bwjhyWHZX5QipGz8yRgTO8ejmUwuxliH.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Battle_TSA_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"レトロこそ、真の最先端だよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/a2kp1Vr0qdZoiB97cfICQFAeMxFfCwmL.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Battle_TSA_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"今からこのゲームはロボットものになるよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/fUEVpE594LcgLWO6BQw5o61V43V1EglO.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Battle_Victory_1","category":"battle","text":"通啦！前往下一关！","text_original":"クリア！次のステージへ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/QJDATysK1MgC4FOz8tClCb4IFioyxe6v.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Battle_Victory_2","category":"battle","text":"我们胜利啦！","text_original":"私たちの勝利！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/hd55Ho6Offz3qxK6ILaQ7nMSOhxSmnE7.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Cafe_Act_1","category":"cafe","text":"啊！突然想到了一个不错的剧情！","text_original":"あっ！唐突に良いシナリオのアイデアが浮かんだ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/WhyylKrSAwkrN6PuZBK1fVlLbHWUHH70.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Cafe_Act_2","category":"cafe","text":"好耶！通关！","text_original":"やった！クリア！！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/RfI8LT5wxExmtfYkE9odVC3TzUAUL2C1.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"游戏~游戏~我想玩游戏~","text_original":"ゲーム～ゲ～ム～ゲームがやりたい～","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/PSUMdUZOMuuMeOPwYfXTwHgZaeSNtag9.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"诶？这不是……我小时候玩过的那个系列吗？！","text_original":"あれ？これちっちゃい時にやったあのシリーズじゃん！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/r5kCBSip4YzJfCJ26VcXjd5tbzT67AOB.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"唔——开发部的零食钱快要不够了。要不，去打个工吧。","text_original":"うーん、これじゃ部員たちのおやつ代が足りない。アルバイトでもしようかな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/9FQrwz5bknbEZxrkQ2vG7bxaBoDyYF2o.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_CommonSkill","category":"battle","text":"我生气了！","text_original":"私、もう怒ったんだから！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/tGmbbEouL56SsiZrUSayu4dh09uGs32d.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_ExSkill_1","category":"battle","text":"好，就这样！啊？饶不了你！","text_original":"よしこのまま……えっ！？ううーっ許せなーい！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/oLSmRpiX96Uuvs086wqN8J61AGaIhzYJ.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_ExSkill_2","category":"battle","text":"欸，真有意……嗯，死了？太离谱了吧！","text_original":"へぇー面白っ……えっ！？死んだ！？信じられなーい！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/m7tzD1Q13ofxMktSrmt0X7XXZId3MfY7.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_ExSkill_3","category":"battle","text":"我赢了……哈，怎么输了？气死我啦！","text_original":"私の勝ち……えっ！？負けたじゃん！？もー！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/dYsMC2ZuAnQzADTiG6XndQBFmCRlMfPz.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_ExSkill_Level_1","category":"battle","text":"这下我得请冰淇凌了呀，都怪你们！","text_original":"アイス奢らなきゃいけなくなったじゃん！あなたたちのせいだよー！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/ScTCg1FTZRx8tvuvhHQBpzwSs2PUYqZM.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_ExSkill_Level_2","category":"battle","text":"不甘心……我不甘心！","text_original":"悔しいっ……悔しいーーっ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/SMDzCLw3lXD5YFiWfDRsWigzcpnjZUEU.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_ExSkill_Level_3","category":"battle","text":"吃我这愤怒的子弹吧！","text_original":"私の怒りの弾丸を食らえ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/qfjaa3LLoWSaPWccKimH1m9Abbirf0fe.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_ExWeapon_Get","category":"growup","text":"这……这就是……我的专用装备！这样一来，我也是超强化型JK了！","text_original":"こ……これが……私の専用装備！ これで私も、超強化型JK！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/3Y1UvmoYOHQi46Np24nZUvKVGCEKi5WK.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Formation_In_1","category":"formation","text":"交给我吧！","text_original":"任せてよー！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/UXyaK6IsQbQdsfESErb6jaoxJjVZ1Yf9.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Formation_In_2","category":"formation","text":"好！轮到我啦！","text_original":"さぁ、私の番か！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/BZWiPNaCvjVPEFIzt7aGdU23cpCgnJoK.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Formation_Select","category":"formation","text":"啊！哎呀，这样我没法玩游戏了！","text_original":"ひゃぁ！？ちょっ、これじゃぁゲームできないじゃん！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/uLd69yFp8nhhuq1tYrrCKL4UPXTynm35.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Gachaget","category":"growup","text":"超——级有趣的故事，即将开始咯！","text_original":"これから、すっごく面白い物語が始まるよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/jIKXT4JfW5iTChdWwHqSMcqsX9TmjlC8.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Growup_1","category":"growup","text":"再多给我点经验值。","text_original":"経験値をもっともらえるようにして！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/RLOs1gmLfdkWxWQR05gbBa0pbWRUaHW0.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Growup_2","category":"growup","text":"每次升级都是一个人心跳的瞬间呢！","text_original":"レベルアップっていつもときめく瞬間だよね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/qo0ykD5XA3mJIv5GplYzgDMprqXIYPLA.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Growup_3","category":"growup","text":"我想变得更强，那样就能成为一个保护大家的好姐姐了。","text_original":"もっと強くなりたい！そうすれば、皆を守れるお姉ちゃんになれるから！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/HcRAc0GwnpXp9Sehb7I8uPh5iUvkhrRw.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Growup_4","category":"growup","text":"以后我的火力可就不是闹着玩的啦！","text_original":"これからの私の火力、ハンパじゃないよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/dWny0BRltt7MWk4VUcHDGyGg6W6v6yUs.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"喜欢游戏和擅长游戏的人还挺不一样的。 老师属于哪一种呢？","text_original":"ゲームを楽しめる人とゲームが上手い人は別なことも多いよ。 先生はどっち？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/5gTNZuEeXkwhIPbR4M8Sbz4VVawI0X4W.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"啊！今天有新的游戏要发售来着！","text_original":"あっ！今日新作のゲームの発売日だった！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/lZmzFspbJiXamyOY1Aa6MXT5GcClIB9t.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"本来今天想去打团队副本的！怎么偏偏轮到我值日啊……！ ……唉，算啦，值日我也挺喜欢的。","text_original":"元々今日はレイドに行こうと思ってたのに！ 当番になっちゃうなんて……！ ·……まぁ、こっちも好きだからいいけど。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/N8JFT9FWEnfOZIooUh7lzgwgRuLWX2NN.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"老师！任务什么的以后再做，先去玩游戏吧！","text_original":"先生！任務とかは後でいいからとりあえずゲームしに行こう！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/alqEnr0wwhutDac6TrD8lTLzZqKrQ32y.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"真羡慕老师啊……老师想买什么游戏都可以随便买吧？","text_original":"先生はいいな……。欲しいゲームがあったらいつでも買えるんでしょ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/ZiHJscQn7jmG1jZ1dHFuvNtdOQhHWpIY.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_LogIn_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师你来啦！快点开始做任务吧！","text_original":"おかえり、先生！早く任務を始めよう！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/0jfys35J6dnObflpT3ZJbK0nfndy2DrI.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_LogIn_2","category":"lobby","text":"准备完毕——老师快走，去完成下一个任务吧！","text_original":"準備完了！行こう、先生！次のクエストをクリアしに！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/kBxE1dhbUrAeMVcFCg1MXlOFhl3Wcpkn.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_MemorialLobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"对小绿要保密啊，绝对要保密！","text_original":"ミ、ミドリには内緒だからね、絶対に内緒だから！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/AvjOIXqgTJgdsanEWDr4Ogs855pmzLAy.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_MemorialLobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师，你快看！这里面的图章，我已经全部都盖满啦！","text_original":"見て、先生！こっち側のスタンプ、全部集められたよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/d0I0FxaUGDEnGXYsMjCgI9x0UqpyLDef.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_MemorialLobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"这样的话任务就通关啦，对吧！耶！","text_original":"これでクエストクリア、だね！やった！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/3Cqqyf14HylMCCb35Cm8OXNYHsZpBR07.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_MemorialLobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"一开始还以为绝对不可能完成……","text_original":"最初どうなるかと思ったけど……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/Hl7gIdLbKR83m5O3yED2WvBso5u71qfK.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_MemorialLobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"果然老师和我两个，就是完美的搭档啊！","text_original":"やっぱり先生と私、相性バッチリだね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/hlirzBEA11FNMHxX2G9w8myzzwhloiJH.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_MemorialLobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"呜，哇啊啊！老师？！","text_original":"って、うわぁっ！？先生？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/t9MNmjzMn2vsKt3IZb0vgWvBtOCMHN2N.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_MemorialLobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"你怎么满头大汗啊？！没事吧？！","text_original":"汗まみれじゃん！大丈夫？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/5A2dVclwDJZP36Poke8U2pmai9hOFgmO.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_MemorialLobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"啊哈哈！没什么事情那就好！今天真的多亏了老师，玩得超——级开心！","text_original":"あはっ、大丈夫なら良かった。今日も先生のおかげで、すっごく楽しかったよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/Edbvmsn37nyIEIRWeZx7ZHFhE36OXbWC.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_MemorialLobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"如果下次还有这样子的活动……","text_original":"もしまたこういうイベントがあったら","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/sp3pwOaFqKkzE5qmvWHmWep1FD8ZGKWy.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_MemorialLobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"那么到时候，我们再两人一起参加吧，老师！","text_original":"その時もまた、一緒に参加しようね、先生！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/Pidlos81Y30XQTm1zdY0eeui6P6Zfej2.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Relationship_Up_1","category":"growup","text":"想提高我的好感度，那就多买点新游戏吧！","text_original":"私の好感度を上げたいなら、新作のゲームをも～っと買って！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/cGLypjID1zNyChXn90xJm7IXVQIVckCj.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Relationship_Up_2","category":"growup","text":"居，居然还有这种伏笔，这要下去，到底会怎么样啊？","text_original":"な…なんて伏線……！このまま行ったらどうなっちゃうんだろう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/d3cO3yroFOZfWLGIpy1bddU8x22ryWFY.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Relationship_Up_3","category":"growup","text":"刚才的难道是，flag，不、不行，不许立！","text_original":"あれ？もしかして今フラグ……。ち、違う！立ってない！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/ZEpdSdt2FiAf8YyeuTkMBhzlngfOC3pS.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Relationship_Up_4","category":"growup","text":"看来要做出最好的游戏,必须要积累各种各样的经验，应该……也包括……恋爱经验吧。","text_original":"最高のゲームを作るためには、やっぱり色んな経験が必要なの。…恋愛経験も、ね？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/dDNfmURGWx9VHGz8phcOGVbDf00dpdJT.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Season_Birthday","category":"lobby","text":"老师！今天是我和小绿的生日！ 买个双人合作游戏嘛~","text_original":"先生！今日は私とミドリの誕生日なの！一緒にできる2人用ゲーム買って～。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/U2dkFhKsmQ5BXFR6XcnA7ytp1Nxu3iBz.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Season_Birthday_Player","category":"lobby","text":"老师！生日快乐！今天跟我们游戏开发部的大家一起去吃好吃的吧！","text_original":"先生！お誕生日おめでとう！今日はゲーム開発部のみんなと一緒に美味しいもの食べに行こう！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/o6CCJ4nYNWRqsKKRBVuT2t3uysz8ozI3.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Season_Halloween","category":"lobby","text":"哇！万圣节！总觉得好兴奋啊！老师！快点给我糖！","text_original":"わあ！ハロウィンだ！なんだかワクワクする！先生！早く飴ちょうだい！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/hZjifrBh4NlmBl18nByUc5IkhzZhDCe8.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Season_NewYear","category":"lobby","text":"Happy New Year！今年也开心地玩游戏吧！","text_original":"ハッピーニューイヤー！今年も楽しくゲームやろ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/bLYEpF4x51gtsoMc15ONojROqKNA5nhq.ogg"},{"description":"Momoi_Season_Xmas","category":"lobby","text":"圣诞节呀……啊—— 要是老师穿上红衣服送我游戏机，那就是最棒的圣诞节了！","text_original":"クリスマスか……うーん、先生が赤い服を着て、ゲーム機をプレゼントしてくれたら最高のクリスマスなのに！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%8D%E7%BE%BD%E6%A1%83%E4%BA%95/q6gVyOHu0CGm4UbHv82tN0DKIhIzZByr.ogg"}